<title>POLAND: Farm Food plans no dividend for 1996.</title>
<headline>Farm Food plans no dividend for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish meat producer Farm Food SA will vote to pay no dividend for 1996 at its shareholders meeting on April 16, the firm said in a statement on Wedneday.</p>
<p>Farm Food wants to put last year's entire nine-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
